                <pb facs="1295" n="1275" sameAs="frus:frus1950v07/pg1275"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">330/11–3050: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United States Representative at the United
                        Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Austin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-11-30T21:48:00-05:00">November 30,
                            1950—9:48 p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 30—10:14 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>917. Indian contacts with Chinese Communist Delegation. Re mytel 914 November 30.
                    USGADel informed by Indian Delegation after close SC meeting today that Sir B.
                    N. Rau had definite appointment <pb facs="1296" n="1276" xml:id="pg1276"/> call
                    on General Wu of Chinese Communist Delegation tomorrow at 11 a. m. Indian
                    informant stated Rau did not intend make any specific suggestions this occasion,
                    but had primarily in mind ascertaining what nature Wu’s thinking on present
                    situation.</p>
                <p>Department please repeat AmEmbassy New Delhi as USUN 6.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Austin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
